Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-刚才怎么了 -没什么\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-What was that? -Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-给我点小提示就好 -不 不能给提示\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-Okay, just give me one little hint. -No. No hints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.97,0:00:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快到了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要拿掉了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Okay, I'm going to take this off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不 你说喜欢惊喜的\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}No, no, no. Hey, you said you like surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.06,0:00:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 没错 但我总得知道是什么\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Yeah, I do. When I know what they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.73,0:00:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会很爱的\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}You're going to love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:00:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.57,0:01:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我爱这风景\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Yeah. I already love the view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.47,0:01:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}All right. Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心脚步\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Watch your step. Watch your step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.35,0:01:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看不见\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}I can't see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 往前 停住\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Okay. Move forward. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以拿下来了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Now taking it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.27,0:01:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的?\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Are you kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会 我都不知道这里开幕了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}How? I... I... I didn't even know this place was open yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:02:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我托人把我们列入开幕夜名单\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}I pulled some favors and I got us on the list for opening night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定我穿这样可以?\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Are you sure I'm dressed all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来美极了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}You look like a million bucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.39,0:02:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:31.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.12,0:02:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别偷喷泉里的硬币\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Don't steal coins from the fountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会带来厄运\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}It's bad luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-抱歉 先生 -去吧\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-Sorry, sir. -Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,微笑\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.47,0:02:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-您的票 -谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-Here's your ticket. -Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-您好 想要拍照吗 -谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-Hello, sir. Would you like a photo? -Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家注意脚步\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Watch your step, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.27,0:03:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要进来吗\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}You coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们坐下一班\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}We'll take the next one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 挤得下\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Ah, come on. We can fit you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.57,0:03:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上楼\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Going up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请见谅\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Oh, excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.71,0:03:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 有时会这样\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Sorry. It does that sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（最大容量1300磅或8名成人）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于天景塔的冷知识\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Some fun facts about the Sky View Tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高494英尺 9,000多吨重\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}It's 494 feet tall and weighs over 9,000 tons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由钢铁 钢筋混凝土和玻璃盖成\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}It's made of steel and reinforced concrete and glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更厉害的是整个计划\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}And even more impressive, the entire project{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.79,0:04:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比预期提前五个月完成\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}was completed five months ahead of schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是好事吗\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Is that a good thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是盖的吧?\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}What did I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好高级 -您好\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-Fancy. -Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}May I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:04:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有订位 坎贝尔\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}We have a reservation. Campbell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 已经满了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Oh, I'm sorry, but we're already over capacity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.06,0:05:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开幕夜没有空位了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}for opening night. We cannot accommodate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请让开 感谢\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}If you wouldn't mind just stepping aside. Thank you so much. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我跟杰克说了 他在吗 我想找他\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}I worked it out with Jake. Is he here? I could speak with--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们今早开除了杰克 感谢\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}We let Jake go this morning. Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-怎么回事 -等一下\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-What's going on? -One second, one second. Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.83,0:05:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 我很尊重你 但请你帮帮我\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Sir, I know you're a very important man, um, but maybe you could help me out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让我很为难 抱歉 我帮不了你\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}You're tearing me apart. But I'm sorry, I can't help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请到旁边\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Now, if you wouldn't mind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.05,0:05:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,富勒先生 欢迎 我们为您准备了好位子\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Oh, Mr. Fuller! How nice to see you. We have a lovely table for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.01,0:05:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 这边请\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Thank you. This way, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们去酒吧 -什么\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-Let's go to the bar. -What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.93,0:05:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表现自然点\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Just act natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这景观\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Wow. Look at that view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糗大了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怕高\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}You're scared of heights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 没事 我只是…\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}What? Oh, no. I'm just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没来过这么高的地方\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}I've just never been this high up before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 今晚老是出丑 我多希望一切完美\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}I'm so sorry. This night's turning into such a disaster. I really wanted it to be perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.97,0:06:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够完美了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}It is perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我跟你在一起\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Because I'm with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-死不了 -是吗\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-I think I'll live. -Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 免费香槟\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Hey, look, free champagne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最爱的酒\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}That's my favorite kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随即奉上\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Coming right up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好了 -我马上回来\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-Okay. -I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问洗手间在哪\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Excuse me. Where's the ladies' room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舞池的另一边\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Other side of the dance floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 马上回来\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Thank you. We'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:07:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Hi, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都还好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Is everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好 谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}I'm fine. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怀孕多久了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}How far along are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.83,0:08:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有…\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}No. I'm not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.47,0:08:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定 也许一两个月\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}I don't know, exactly. Maybe one or two months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好消息\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}That's wonderful news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.73,0:08:34.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没告诉我男朋友\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}I haven't told my boyfriend yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他爱你吗\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Does he love you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他就不会放手\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Then he won't let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-谢谢 -不客气\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-Thank you. -Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 快结束了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Okay. It's almost over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到你了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.18,0:09:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该吧\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:09.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去透透气\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Let's get some fresh air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我真的需要… -我想…\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-I really need---I wanted to--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先说\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Uh... you go first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来想在晚餐时说 但这里太美了\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}-I was going to do this at dinner, but seeing as we have this view...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别丢硬币 会害死人\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Don't throw that penny. It could kill somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 没问题\N{\fs12\1c&H64B7D7&}Oh, I'm so sorry. Of course. Yeah.{\r}
